option.MOTION_BLUR=Motion Blur
option.MOTION_BLUR.comment=Camera-motion blur. Moving entities do not have independent motion vectors.
option.MOTION_BLUR_NOISE=Motion Blur Noise
option.MOTION_BLUR_NOISE.comment=Jitter samples to reduce visible bands along the blur.
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH=Motion Blur Strength
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.comment=Native CH Motion strength response and default: 5.5.
option.MOTION_BLUR_SAMPLES=Motion Blur Samples
option.MOTION_BLUR_SAMPLES.comment=Native CH sample setting. Uses a centered odd sample count: setting 8 takes 7 samples. More samples cost more GPU time.
option.VANILLA_GAMMA=Compatibility Gamma
option.VANILLA_GAMMA.comment=Advanced post-blur gamma. Leave at 1.0 to preserve the shader tone mapping.
option.EXCLUDE_HAND_MOTION_BLUR=Exclude Hand / Held Items from Blur
option.EXCLUDE_HAND_MOTION_BLUR.comment=Adds an explicit hand/held-item mask around unchanged CH Motion. CH Motion also always retains its native close-depth cutoff.
option.REMOVE_HAND_TINT=Remove Hand / Held Item Shader Tint
option.REMOVE_HAND_TINT.comment=Removes lighting color casts. Keeps texture colors, environment brightness and applicable shadows in every dimension.
option.REMOVE_ENTITY_DIMENSION_TINT=Remove Entity Dimension Tint
option.REMOVE_ENTITY_DIMENSION_TINT.comment=Neutralizes Nether/End ambient illumination on entities and block entities. Keeps local lights and damage flashes.
option.MINIMUM_VISIBILITY=Minimum Visibility
option.MINIMUM_VISIBILITY.comment=Adds neutral minimum illumination to surfaces, including sealed rooms. Does not brighten the sky or black texture pixels.
option.MIN_VISIBILITY_STRENGTH=Minimum Illumination
option.MIN_VISIBILITY_STRENGTH.comment=Higher values make unlit surfaces easier to see. Default 0.08; tune in a completely enclosed room.
option.FOG_ENABLED=Fog
option.FOG_ENABLED.comment=Master switch for every fog contribution implemented by this pack.
option.FOG_START=Fog Start (% of Render Distance)
option.FOG_START.comment=Fog begins at this fraction of render distance. Default 0.90 means the final 10%.
option.FOG_END=Fog End (% of Render Distance)
option.FOG_END.comment=Fog reaches its selected strength here. End is safely bounded if set before Start.
option.FOG_STRENGTH=Fog Strength
option.FOG_STRENGTH.comment=Scales all fog categories. Zero removes fog. Default 0.25 keeps the distant edge weak.
option.FOG_DAY=Day Fog
option.FOG_DAY.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.FOG_NIGHT=Night Fog
option.FOG_NIGHT.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.FOG_RAIN=Rain / Storm Fog
option.FOG_RAIN.comment=Rain and thunderstorms share the rainStrength uniform and this control.
option.FOG_NETHER=Nether Fog
option.FOG_NETHER.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.FOG_END_DIMENSION=End Fog
option.FOG_END_DIMENSION.comment=Controls End haze, including the replacement for the original height fog.
option.FOG_WATER=Underwater Fog
option.FOG_WATER.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.FOG_LAVA=Lava Fog
option.FOG_LAVA.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.FOG_POWDER_SNOW=Powder Snow Fog
option.FOG_POWDER_SNOW.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.FOG_BLINDNESS=Blindness Fog
option.FOG_BLINDNESS.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.FOG_DARKNESS=Darkness Fog
option.FOG_DARKNESS.comment=Enable this fog category. Uses the shared edge-only start and end distances.
option.TRANSPARENT_WATER=Transparent Water
option.TRANSPARENT_WATER.comment=Use the YoFPS-derived color and opacity on water only. Glass retains its normal texture and alpha.
option.WATER_OPACITY=Water Opacity
option.WATER_OPACITY.comment=0 is clear, 1 is opaque. YoFPS reference default: 0.45.
option.WATER_R=Water Red
option.WATER_G=Water Green
option.WATER_B=Water Blue
option.WATER_WAVES=Water Waves
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Optional YoFPS-derived geometric displacement. Off by default. Adds vertex work.
option.WATER_RIPPLES=Water Surface Ripples
option.WATER_RIPPLES.comment=Optional procedural water-surface texture distortion. Off by default; no screen-space reflections or scene refraction.
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH=Water Wave Strength
option.WATER_RIPPLE_STRENGTH=Water Ripple Strength
option.SUN_GLARE=Sun / Moon Glare
option.SUN_GLARE.comment=Original Toaster glow around the sun/moon. Disabling removes its visibility sampling work.
option.SUN_GLARE_SAMPLES=Glare Visibility Samples
option.SUN_GLARE_SAMPLES.comment=Original default: 1000. Lower values reduce vertex texture reads but may change partial occlusion.
option.TORCH_AMOUNT=Local Light Brightness
option.TORCH_R=Local Light Red
option.TORCH_G=Local Light Green
option.TORCH_B=Local Light Blue
option.EXPOSURE_MULTIPLIER=Exposure
option.TONEMAP_ACES=ACES Tone Mapping (Overworld)
option.TONEMAP_ACES.comment=Changes the Overworld curve. Nether and End retain their original ACES curve.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Path Rotation
option.SEPARATE_AO=Separate Ambient Occlusion
option.ambientOcclusionLevel=Ambient Occlusion
option.SKY_BRIGHTNESS_DAY=Day Sky Brightness
option.SKY_BRIGHTNESS_NIGHT=Night Sky Brightness
option.FOG_DAY_STRENGTH=Day Fog Strength
option.FOG_DAY_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_NIGHT_STRENGTH=Night Fog Strength
option.FOG_NIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_RAIN_STRENGTH=Rain / Storm Fog Strength
option.FOG_RAIN_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_NETHER_STRENGTH=Nether Fog Strength
option.FOG_NETHER_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_END_STRENGTH=Fog End (% of Render Distance) Strength
option.FOG_END_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_WATER_STRENGTH=Underwater Fog Strength
option.FOG_WATER_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_LAVA_STRENGTH=Lava Fog Strength
option.FOG_LAVA_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_POWDER_SNOW_STRENGTH=Powder Snow Fog Strength
option.FOG_POWDER_SNOW_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_BLINDNESS_STRENGTH=Blindness Fog Strength
option.FOG_BLINDNESS_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
option.FOG_DARKNESS_STRENGTH=Darkness Fog Strength
option.FOG_DARKNESS_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplies this category by the global Fog Strength. Zero removes its contribution.
