option.NETHER_SKY_MIN_BRIGHTNESS=Nether Sky Minimum Brightness
option.NETHER_SKY_MIN_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Keeps the vanilla biome-colored Nether background faintly visible. Preserves its hue; does not add nearby fog.
option.END_STARS=End Stars
option.END_STARS.comment=Complementary-derived End stars, without volumetric beam/altitude attenuation.
option.END_STAR_INTENSITY=End Star Intensity
option.END_SKY_TEXTURE=End Sky Texture
option.END_SKY_TEXTURE.comment=Complementary-derived noise layer. Four texture reads per sky pixel; no volumetric ray marching or flashes.
